<title>ITALY: Bank of Italy sets 9.5 trillion lire repo tender.</title>
<headline>Bank of Italy sets 9.5 trillion lire repo tender.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Italy said it called a 9.5 trillion lire repurchase tender for today for government securities to be resold on July 15.</p>
<p>At the previous comparable operation for 12.5 trillion lire on June 9, the minimum accepted rate stood at 6.76 percent and the average rate at 6.82 percent.</p>
